OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA warm and
OL,6,Fsunny evening, though fresher and
OL,7,Fbreezier in some coastal regions. Dry
OL,8,Fovernight with prolonged clear periods
OL,9,Fand variable cloud. Staying rather
OL,10,Fwarm in urban areas but considerably
OL,11,Fcooler in the countryside by dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FAnother primarily sunny day
OL,14,Fwith just a little wispy high cloud at
OL,15,Ftimes. Breezier than on Monday and
OL,16,Ffeeling slightly cooler in some
OL,17,Fcoastal regions. Otherwise, becoming
OL,18,Fvery warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
